  },
  {
   "id": "an",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 344,
   "width": 600,
   "height": 48,
   "strokeColor": "#b91c1c",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100017,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700119,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Debit succeeds, credit fails   ->  money has VANISHED\nCredit succeeds, debit fails   ->  money has been CREATED, which is worse:\n                                   it is a mint, and it is unrecoverable",
   "originalText": "Debit succeeds, credit fails   ->  money has VANISHED\nCredit succeeds, debit fails   ->  money has been CREATED, which is worse:\n                                   it is a mint, and it is unrecoverable",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "an2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 412,
   "width": 511,
   "height": 97,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100018,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700126,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "And unlike most systems you cannot resolve this by being\neventually consistent and moving on. A wallet is AUDITED -\nsomeone will ask, months later, what a balance was on a\nspecific afternoon and why. 'Our reconciliation job fixed\nthe discrepancy' is not an answer to 'why'. That second,\nindependent constraint is what pushes this into event sourcing.",
   "originalText": "And unlike most systems you cannot resolve this by being\neventually consistent and moving on. A wallet is AUDITED -\nsomeone will ask, months later, what a balance was on a\nspecific afternoon and why. 'Our reconciliation job fixed\nthe discrepancy' is not an answer to 'why'. That second,\nindependent constraint is what pushes this into event sourcing.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
