  {
   "id": "cl",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 534,
   "width": 636,
   "height": 21,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100040,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700280,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Three ideas, each solving a problem the previous one exposes",
   "originalText": "Three ideas, each solving a problem the previous one exposes",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "id_30",
   "type": "ellipse",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 574,
   "width": 12,
   "height": 12,
   "strokeColor": "#3b82f6",
   "backgroundColor": "#3b82f6",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100041,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700287,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "idn_30",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 56,
   "y": 570,
   "width": 333,
   "height": 17,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100042,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700294,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. Two local transactions, coordinated",
   "originalText": "1. Two local transactions, coordinated",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "idd_30",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 56,
   "y": 596,
   "width": 428,
   "height": 45,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100043,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700301,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "No single transaction spans both shards, so the transfer\nbecomes debit-then-credit with a coordinator guaranteeing\nboth happen or neither's effect survives.",
   "originalText": "No single transaction spans both shards, so the transfer\nbecomes debit-then-credit with a coordinator guaranteeing\nboth happen or neither's effect survives.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "id_580",
   "type": "ellipse",
   "x": 580,
   "y": 574,
   "width": 12,
   "height": 12,
   "strokeColor": "#3b82f6",
   "backgroundColor": "#3b82f6",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100044,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700308,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "idn_580",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 606,
   "y": 570,
   "width": 333,
   "height": 17,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100045,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700315,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "2. Store the CHANGES, not the balances",
   "originalText": "2. Store the CHANGES, not the balances",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "idd_580",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 606,
   "y": 596,
   "width": 465,
   "height": 45,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100046,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700322,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Instead of UPDATE balance = 90, append Debited(A, 10).\nThe balance becomes a FOLD over history - which is what\nmakes audit and reproducibility satisfiable, not approximable.",
   "originalText": "Instead of UPDATE balance = 90, append Debited(A, 10).\nThe balance becomes a FOLD over history - which is what\nmakes audit and reproducibility satisfiable, not approximable.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "id_1130",
   "type": "ellipse",
   "x": 1130,
   "y": 574,
   "width": 12,
   "height": 12,
   "strokeColor": "#3b82f6",
   "backgroundColor": "#3b82f6",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100047,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700329,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "idn_1130",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1156,
   "y": 570,
   "width": 333,
   "height": 17,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100048,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700336,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "3. Only the event log must be reliable",
   "originalText": "3. Only the event log must be reliable",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "idd_1130",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1156,
   "y": 596,
   "width": 457,
   "height": 45,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100049,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700343,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Once balances are derived, state and snapshots are CACHES.\nSo durability concentrates on one append-only structure -\nexactly the structure cheapest to make fast and to replicate.",
   "originalText": "Once balances are derived, state and snapshots are CACHES.\nSo durability concentrates on one append-only structure -\nexactly the structure cheapest to make fast and to replicate.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "cn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 668,
   "width": 987,
   "height": 48,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100050,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700350,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The pleasing part is how the three requirements collapse into ONE mechanism. Correctness needs the two legs coordinated;\nauditability needs history retained; throughput needs sequential writes. An append-only event log per shard, replicated by\nconsensus, delivers all three - and none of them individually would have forced that design.",
   "originalText": "The pleasing part is how the three requirements collapse into ONE mechanism. Correctness needs the two legs coordinated;\nauditability needs history retained; throughput needs sequential writes. An append-only event log per shard, replicated by\nconsensus, delivers all three - and none of them individually would have forced that design.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d3",
   "type": "line",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 736,
   "width": 1660,
